@base = http://localhost:5256

### Get Wallet
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/2
Accept: application/json


### topup
POST {{base}}/api/wallets/2/topups
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentMethodId" : 1,
    "amount" : 45000
}



### Transfer
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "senderWalletId": 1,
    "receiverWalletId": 6,
    "amount": 5000,
    "description": "Transfer ke teman"
}



### history
GET {{base}}/api/users/6/transactions
Accept: application/json